  "scientific_statement": "Across 51007 verified clinical variant discrepancy records spanning 536 genes, the median cross-sectional synchronization latency was 2.82 years (median 1030 days, IQR 1087 days). Comparison between Multi-Submitter Consensus (\u22652 submitters) (median 2.80 years, N = 17747) and Single-Submitter Assertion (1 submitter) (median 2.84 years, N = 33260) yielded Mann-Whitney U p = < 0.001. Because static snapshot records reflect active unresolved discrepancies, genuine longitudinal time-to-event resolution modeling requires multi-year submission revision snapshots."
